000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL-V1.
000300*
000400* M1 Stage 1: single flat-file payroll program.
000500* Reads a sequential fixed-width employee file, computes gross
000600* pay (gross = hours * rate; no overtime/tax in Stage 1), and
000700* writes a formatted report with one line per employee plus a
000800* total-gross line and an employee-count line.
000900*
001000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001200 FILE-CONTROL.
001300     SELECT EMPLOYEE-FILE ASSIGN TO "data/employees.dat"
001400         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
001500     SELECT REPORT-FILE   ASSIGN TO "data/payroll-report.out"
001600         ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
001700*
001800 DATA DIVISION.
001900 FILE SECTION.
002000 FD EMPLOYEE-FILE.
002100 01 EMPLOYEE-RECORD.
002200     05 EMP-ID              PIC 9(4).
002300     05 EMP-NAME            PIC X(20).
002400     05 EMP-HOURS           PIC 9(3)V99.
002500     05 EMP-RATE            PIC 9(3)V99.
002600*
002700 FD REPORT-FILE.
002800 01 REPORT-LINE             PIC X(54).
002900*
003000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003100 01 WS-EOF-FLAG             PIC X VALUE "N".
003200     88 END-OF-FILE         VALUE "Y".
003300*
003400 01 WS-GROSS-PAY            PIC 9(5)V99.
003500 01 WS-TOTAL-GROSS          PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
003600 01 WS-EMP-COUNT            PIC 9(3)    VALUE ZERO.
003700*
003800* Report headings.
003900 01 WS-TITLE-LINE           PIC X(24)
004000     VALUE "PAYROLL REPORT - STAGE 1".
004100 01 WS-UNDER-LINE           PIC X(24)
004200     VALUE "========================".
004300 01 WS-COL-HEADER.
004400     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
004500     05 FILLER              PIC X(4)  VALUE "  ID".
004600     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
004700     05 FILLER              PIC X(20) VALUE "NAME".
004800     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
004900     05 FILLER              PIC X(6)  VALUE " HOURS".
005000     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
005100     05 FILLER              PIC X(6)  VALUE "  RATE".
005200     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
005300     05 FILLER              PIC X(8)  VALUE "   GROSS".
005400*
005500* Detail line with edited (display) PICTUREs.
005600 01 WS-DETAIL-LINE.
005700     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
005800     05 WS-D-ID             PIC 9(4).
005900     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
006000     05 WS-D-NAME           PIC X(20).
006100     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
006200     05 WS-D-HOURS          PIC ZZ9.99.
006300     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
006400     05 WS-D-RATE           PIC ZZ9.99.
006500     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
006600     05 WS-D-GROSS          PIC Z,ZZ9.99.
006700*
006800 01 WS-TOTAL-OUT-LINE.
006900     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
007000     05 FILLER              PIC X(16) VALUE "TOTAL GROSS PAY:".
007100     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
007200     05 WS-T-GROSS          PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99.
007300*
007400 01 WS-COUNT-OUT-LINE.
007500     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
007600     05 FILLER              PIC X(16) VALUE "EMPLOYEE COUNT:".
007700     05 FILLER              PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
007800     05 WS-T-COUNT          PIC ZZ9.
007900*
008000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
008100 000-MAIN.
008200     OPEN INPUT  EMPLOYEE-FILE.
008300     OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-FILE.
008400     PERFORM 100-WRITE-HEADERS.
008500     READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
008600         AT END SET END-OF-FILE TO TRUE
008700     END-READ.
008800     PERFORM 200-PROCESS-EMPLOYEE UNTIL END-OF-FILE.
008900     PERFORM 300-WRITE-TOTALS.
009000     CLOSE EMPLOYEE-FILE.
009100     CLOSE REPORT-FILE.
009200     STOP RUN.
009300*
009400 100-WRITE-HEADERS.
009500     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-TITLE-LINE.
009600     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-UNDER-LINE.
009700     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-COL-HEADER.
009800*
009900 200-PROCESS-EMPLOYEE.
010000     COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = EMP-HOURS * EMP-RATE.
010100     ADD WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-TOTAL-GROSS.
010200     ADD 1 TO WS-EMP-COUNT.
010300     MOVE EMP-ID    TO WS-D-ID.
010400     MOVE EMP-NAME  TO WS-D-NAME.
010500     MOVE EMP-HOURS TO WS-D-HOURS.
010600     MOVE EMP-RATE  TO WS-D-RATE.
010700     MOVE WS-GROSS-PAY TO WS-D-GROSS.
010800     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-DETAIL-LINE.
010900     READ EMPLOYEE-FILE
011000         AT END SET END-OF-FILE TO TRUE
011100     END-READ.
011200*
011300 300-WRITE-TOTALS.
011400     MOVE WS-UNDER-LINE   TO REPORT-LINE.
011500     WRITE REPORT-LINE.
011600     MOVE WS-TOTAL-GROSS  TO WS-T-GROSS.
011700     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-TOTAL-OUT-LINE.
011800     MOVE WS-EMP-COUNT    TO WS-T-COUNT.
011900     WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-COUNT-OUT-LINE.
